&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Next Challenge:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Open Ecosystem? We are building the foundation to foster years of open science and research on AI models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All interns are paired with one or more mentors from the Open Ecosystem team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage open collaboration on intern projects, even with researchers at external institutions. We have close ties to the University of Washington, only 1.5 miles away.&lt;/li&gt;
