&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.10611&quot;&gt;Molmo2: Open Weights and Data for Vision-Language Models with Video Understanding and Grounding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
