&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across the stack: web UIs, backend services, CLIs, and cloud tooling. You move between them as the work needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping products to external users and talking with those users directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment about priorities: you fix blockers first and keep scope small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean, tested code, and experience reviewing other people&#39;s code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opinions about API design, and a preference for simple designs over clever ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI coding tools such as Claude Code, including writing your own skills or tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to write documentation as part of the work rather than after it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear technical communication with engineers and non-engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
