&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building developer tools, CLIs, SDKs, or public APIs for outside users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or running LLM agents, including prompts, tools, and evals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building evaluation or experimentation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
